  "description": "One configured sync: a source app and connection, a trigger, and the automation cloned to run it. The destination is always a UnifyApps object, so there is no destination app or connection here. Field-level configuration lives on PipelineMapping and is read at run time, never baked into the automation - which is what lets a remap take effect with no redeploy.",
